# CODEOWNERS — maps repo paths to required reviewers. GitHub auto-requests
# review from the matching owner(s) when a PR touches those paths.
#
# Rule: LAST matching pattern wins (opposite of .gitignore's first-match).
# Order general -> specific so a specific rule below overrides the default.
#
# Solo-maintained today (@xidoke); written team-portable — swap @xidoke for
# @org/team-name without restructuring when the team grows.

# Default: everything needs the repo owner's review.
*                   @xidoke

# Docs: explicit ownership signals review intent + enables future delegation.
/docs/              @xidoke

# ADRs: architectural decisions warrant conscious sign-off.
/docs/adr/          @xidoke

# Guard this file itself — whoever can rewrite it can reroute all reviews.
/.github/CODEOWNERS @xidoke
